    2048   | 623.790        | 22.469         | 601.321       
    ⇒ (D) GAP roughly CONSTANT across N ⇒ FIXED per-launch overhead dominates. ★ GOOD
          NEWS for large models: bigger kernels amortise it, and the ratio improves.
    ⇒ (E) GAP GROWS with N ⇒ we are in the DATA PATH. Name where.

